  "question": {
    "text": "$3.92 \\mathrm{~g}$ of ferrous ammonium sulphate react completely with $50 \\mathrm{ml} \\frac{\\mathrm{N}}{10} \\mathrm{KMnO}_{4}$ solution. The percentage purity of the sample is",
