  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Eq of $\\mathrm{KMnO}_{4}$ used $=\\frac{50 \\times 1}{1000 \\times 10}=0.005$\r\n\r\n$\\therefore$ Eq of FAS reacted $=0.005$\r\n\r\n$\\therefore$ weight of FAS needed\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\n=0.005 \\times 392=1.96 \\mathrm{~g}\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\nThus percentage purity of FAS is $50 \\%$",
